cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or method, please cite the paper below."
title: "S3 — Semantic Similarity Score"
abstract: >-
  A content-based method for science mapping that uses transformer (SBERT) embeddings of titles
  and abstracts, time-masking, and community detection to map the intellectual structure of a
  research field, re-introducing citation data only to characterise and validate communities.
type: software
